    description: "DEEP bakeoff cohort #20 (metabase): Clojure functions like test-ldap-connection, test-database-connection are production code (they test/validate connections) but are classified as test_function entrypoints because of the test- prefix. In Clojure, test- is a naming convention for 'verify this thing', not necessarily a test. Fix: check if the function is in a test namespace (e.g., *_test.clj or test/ directory) before applying the test_function classification. Also: Clojure symbol name conflation via (:refer-clojure :exclude [...]) causes implausible in-degree values."  # 5bc3
    fields: {}  # 5bc3
